{"availability":"available","full":"xing-shuyin/pi-web-ui","name":"pi-web-ui","description":"Just open your browser — get all your work done.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":282,"forks":70,"created":"2026-08-04T01:11:26Z","updated":"2026-10-11T06:51:25Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://xing-shuyin.github.io/pi-web-ui-site/","topics":["dsh","dsh-desktop","dsh-plugin","pi","pi-web","pi-web-ui"],"demo":"https://xing-shuyin.github.io/pi-web-ui-site/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:05.669Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:05.669Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:05.669Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:05.669Z","stars":282,"forks":70}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["English | 简体中文 · 🌐 Official Website · 📖 Documentation Portal","Just open your browser — get all your work done.","Chat, code, review, manage files, use the terminal — all in one browser tab. No IDE, no terminal app, no context-switching."],"features":["Streaming agent chat over WebSocket — the pi SDK runs in-process; events are pushed as snapshots (60 ms throttled) and the browser renders them.","Thinking blocks, tool-call cards and bash outputs with live status (running → finished · waiting for the model · duration).","Steer (follow-up queueing) — send a follow-up while the agent is replying; it is queued and injected as soon as the current turn's tool calls settle (the \"Interrupt\" equivalent of the pi CLI).","Slash commands — / opens a command picker (built-in / extension / template / skill); the built-ins are /new /name /model /compact /cwd /thinking /resume /reload, plus /help (command list), /copy (copy last reply) and…","Multiple conversations per project — each conversation gets its own agent runtime and keeps running in the background after you switch away; the \"Running conversations\" list shows stream progress and lets you switch…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xing-shuyin/pi-web-ui/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"699c715979bcfcbf6b70cc8371e50371f788bf8eb8d7452063613f79daef6cb3","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T04:29:37.582Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:05.730Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"English | 简体中文 · 🌐 Official Website · 📖 Documentation Portal","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xing-shuyin/pi-web-ui/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"On Linux and Windows auto-start is kept (the next login/boot brings it back, until server uninstall); on macOS stop unloads the launchd agent, so it no longer starts at login — pi-web-ui server start brings it back.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xing-shuyin/pi-web-ui/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"pi-web-ui runs entirely on your own machine and has no telemetry, no analytics and no accounts of its own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xing-shuyin/pi-web-ui/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"699c715979bcfcbf6b70cc8371e50371f788bf8eb8d7452063613f79daef6cb3","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xing-shuyin/pi-web-ui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:05.736Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T06:51:25Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/xing-shuyin/pi-web-ui/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:05.748Z","hash":"699c715979bcfcbf6b70cc8371e50371f788bf8eb8d7452063613f79daef6cb3","originalBytes":113015,"storedBytes":113015,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["web","pi-web-ui","server","plugins","install","file","dsh","model","agent","browser","plugin","npm","run","bash","themes","tool","default","terminal","host","only","proxy","own","chat","one","when","panel","settings","copy","list","engine","open","project","tools","back","name","set","theme","every","git","port","see","without","path","directory","folder","plus","repo","api","built-in","conversation","files","first","live","p